# Shipyard CLI environment configuration
#
# Every value here can also be baked in at link time with -ldflags -X. The
# environment variable always wins, which is what makes a released binary
# overridable without a rebuild.

# Version reported by `shipyard version`. Overrides the linked-in value.
# SHIPYARD_VERSION=0.1.0

# Git commit the binary was built from. Overrides the linked-in value.
# SHIPYARD_COMMIT=

# Release channel: stable, test, or dev. When unset it is inferred from the
# version suffix (-dev -> dev, -alpha/-beta/-rc -> test, otherwise stable).
# SHIPYARD_CHANNEL=stable

# Where install.sh places the binary. Defaults to /opt/homebrew/bin on macOS
# when writable, else ~/.shipyard/bin; on Linux /usr/local/bin or ~/.shipyard/bin.
# SHIPYARD_INSTALL_DIR=$HOME/.shipyard/bin

# Credentials consumed by the evaluation engine for LLM-backed agents.
# These belong in your CI secret store, never in a committed file.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
